+# Password Hashing
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use Argon2id as the password hashing algorithm for the authentication system. It was chosen because its memory-hard design resists GPU-based brute-force attacks and it defends against side-channel timing attacks. No specific parameter values (time cost, memory cost, parallelism) have been recorded, so none are specified here.
